    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36839" root="كرتح" body-key="k">
    
      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْتَحَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْتَحَةٌ</span>, <i>He</i> (a short man)
<i>ran with short steps, and quickly;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْدَحَ</span>.
(S, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كردح</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, (TA,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَكَرْتَحَ</span></b> , (K,)
<i>He went quickly</i> in his walk. (K, TA.)

